@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Employee
participant ":System" as System

activate Employee

    Employee -> System : asks to buy a train
    activate System

        System --> Employee : displays list of available locomotives (filtered by scenario and date)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : selects a train category (shop)
    activate System

        System --> Employee : requests train information (type, price, availability)
    deactivate System

    Employee -> System : confirms purchase
    activate System

        System --> Employee : generates unique ID for the locomotive
    deactivate System

    note right of System
   There is no logical limit to the number of locomotives,\n
only the available memory
    end note

        System --> Employee : confirms purchase success
    deactivate System
@enduml